WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.273
Meet Tabby, your focus companion in Chrome.

00:00:03.273 --> 00:00:05.650
Let's build a React login form.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:09.898
Set one clear goal, then start a focus session.

00:00:09.898 --> 00:00:14.050
Tabby checks whether the page supports what you're trying to do.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:17.492
Here, the React documentation is on track.

00:00:17.492 --> 00:00:21.340
Tabby explains why, and suggests a useful next step.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:23.237
A cat video?

00:00:23.237 --> 00:00:24.473
That's a detour.

00:00:24.473 --> 00:00:26.946
Tabby gives you a gentle nudge.

00:00:26.946 --> 00:00:31.480
Click Back to work, and you're right where you left off.

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:35.068
Turn this page into a task.

00:00:35.068 --> 00:00:41.760
Review the AI generated steps, keep the source link, and save it for later.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:45.158
Now, organize your tabs.

00:00:45.158 --> 00:00:48.394
Review the suggested groups, then confirm.

00:00:48.394 --> 00:00:52.170
Tabby creates the groups directly in Chrome.

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:54.496
One goal.

00:00:54.496 --> 00:00:56.689
A clear next step.

00:00:56.689 --> 00:00:58.334
A calmer browser.

00:00:58.334 --> 00:00:59.430
That's Tabby.
